 ask:'"Where is the ambulance?" "What does the ambulance say?" "Who rides inside the ambulance?" "Can you make teddy all better?"',
 childSay:'"Nee-naw!" plus a teddy carried gently to the rug-clinic. Some toddlers will pat every family member better for a week — the caring half of the lesson is the one worth encouraging.',
